text = "  W/A/S/D ........... Move
  Left Click ......... Light Attack
  Right Click ........ Heavy Attack
  Space .............. Dodge Roll
  Q .................. Cast Spell
  E .................. Interact / Talk
  R .................. Cycle Spell
  T .................. Cycle Weapon
  F .................. Use Item (Potion)
  I .................. Inventory
  J .................. Quest Log
  K .................. Skill Tree
  M .................. World Map
  ESC ................ Pause Menu"

